module

public import CFSG.Quasithin.ChapterB.Section01.ComponentRecognition.SylowOvergroups.EvenLieOvergroups.RankOneModels

/-!
# Proper Sylow overgroups in characteristic-two Lie models

This interface currently exports the proved binary PSL₂ and simple Suzuki
branches and their literal component applications. Each bound retains the
ambient centre factor in B.1.13's generalized Fitting calculation. The shared
rank-one reduction makes the separate unitary centralizer calculation usable
without assuming the desired generalized Fitting conclusion.

Higher-rank parabolic placement and central-cover lifting remain separate
mathematical prerequisites; this module does not assert the full Lie branch.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith B.1.13, printed p.74 (PDF p.85).
-/
